    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d279">

                <pb facs="0387" n="313" sameAs="frus:frus1866p2/pg313"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Webb.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 174.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-28"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 28, 1866</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have to acknowledge the receipt of
                    despatch No. 12 of Mr. Lidgerwood, of the 2d of July. It contains an account of
                    certain conversations which took place between himself, joined with acting
                    Rear-Admiral Godon, and the Brazilian minister for foreign affairs, on the
                    subject of the obstruction, by the Allies, of the passage of the United States
                    minister (Mr. Washburn) to Paraguay.</p>
                <p>The conversation which has thus been reported to this department as maintained,
                    on the part of the United States, in those interviews, by Mr. Lidgerwood and the
                    admiral, is approved by the President.</p>
                <p>We wait with serious interest for information of the decision of the Brazilian
                    government upon the subject discussed.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">James Watson Webb,</hi> Esq., &amp;<hi
                            rendition="#italic">c</hi>., &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.,
                            &amp;<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
